From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladimir Skvortsov <vskvortsov@emcraft.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:40:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] imx6sx-slx-som: hab_status: known RNG self-test event on the
 6SoloX

The i.MX 6SoloX boot ROM logs a HAB warning when its CAAM RNG self-test
fails: STS HAB_WARNING, RSN HAB_ENG_FAIL, CTX HAB_CTX_ENTRY, ENG
HAB_ENG_CAAM. The ROM's self-test is wrong; U-Boot runs the test again
and instantiates the RNG ("RNG self test passed"). Toradex's patch
ignores this event on the 6Quad and 6DualLite only, and with 0x04 in
byte 9, so on the 6SoloX hab_status fails on every boot, and Torizon's
fusing, which checks hab_status, never closes the part.

Ignore it on the 6SoloX as well, with 0x08 in byte 9, as the ROM reports
it here. barebox lists the same 36 bytes in habv4_known_rng_fail_events.
hab_status still prints the event, and any other event still fails.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [SoC-specific; extends Toradex's list]
Signed-off-by: Vladimir Skvortsov <vskvortsov@emcraft.com>
---
 common/tdx-hab-utils.c  | 6 ++++++
 include/tdx-hab-utils.h | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/common/tdx-hab-utils.c b/common/tdx-hab-utils.c
index 840a640..fc11681 100644
--- a/common/tdx-hab-utils.c
+++ b/common/tdx-hab-utils.c
@@ -13,6 +13,12 @@ static uint8_t known_rng_fail_event[][RNG_FAIL_EVENT_SIZE] = {
 	  0x55, 0x55, 0x00, 0x03,  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00,
 	  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00,  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00,
 	  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x01 },
+	/* The i.MX 6SoloX boot ROM reports the same event with 0x08 here. */
+	{ 0xdb, 0x00, 0x24, 0x42,  0x69, 0x30, 0xe1, 0x1d,
+	  0x00, 0x08, 0x00, 0x02,  0x40, 0x00, 0x36, 0x06,
+	  0x55, 0x55, 0x00, 0x03,  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00,
+	  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00,  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00,
+	  0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x01 },
 };
 
 bool is_known_fail_event(const uint8_t *data, size_t len)
diff --git a/include/tdx-hab-utils.h b/include/tdx-hab-utils.h
index 316a0a6..8fc768e 100644
--- a/include/tdx-hab-utils.h
+++ b/include/tdx-hab-utils.h
@@ -3,7 +3,8 @@
  * Copyright 2024 Toradex
  */
 
-#if (defined(CONFIG_MX6Q) || defined(CONFIG_MX6DL) || defined(CONFIG_MX6QDL))
+#if (defined(CONFIG_MX6Q) || defined(CONFIG_MX6DL) || defined(CONFIG_MX6QDL) || \
+     defined(CONFIG_MX6SX))
 #define IGNORE_KNOWN_HAB_EVENTS 1
 #endif
 
